{"version":1,"content":"<p>如果你看過2008年的電影《無敵浩克》，大概還記得那幾門用強勁聲波把綠色巨人死死壓住的聲波炮。如今，芬蘭赫爾辛基大學的科學家與西班牙納瓦拉公立大學、美國密歇根大學的研究者合作，讓這一設想有了現實的雛形：一條完全由超聲波構成的「管道」，能夠在空中物理性地約束並引導物質流動。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1584222.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T18:41:48.684196+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T18:31:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T18:38:44.459597+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T18:38:44.459597+00:00","content_hash":"051e6583e3ade2ea379c5eb4e6659adc2ae8f0274bf2b4f6759afff5a2580da6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}